<title>LATVIA: SOCCER-LATVIA V AUSTRIA TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LATVIA V AUSTRIA TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for the World Cup European group four qualifier between Latvia and Austria on Sunday:</p>
<p>Latvia - 1-Oleg Karavajev, 2-Igor Troicki, 3-Vitali Astafjev, 4-Mihail Zemlinski, 5-Juri Shevlakov, 6-Igor Stepanov, 7-Valerij Ivanov, 8-Marian Pahar, 9-Vitas Rimkus, 10-Vladimir Babichev, 11-Imants Bleidelis.</p>
<p>Austria: 1-Michael Konsel, 2-Harald Cerny, 3-Peter Schottel, 4-Anton Pfesser, 5-Wolfgang Seiersinger, 6-Andreas Heraf, 7-Ivica Vastic, 8-Dietmar Kuhbauer, 9-Anton Polster, 10-Andreas Herzog, 11-Arnold Wetel.</p>
</text>
